  TRIAL TYPE         BUILD  UNRECOV  BT-1 INC RESCUED  RATE    CENSORED mean dur
  controlled_hang    stock  0/1      0/1      0/0      0%      0/1      100s
      treatment: autosusp=N

  These rows must never be added together. An observational boot
  and a controlled protocol run are different evidence: the first
  says the machine did or did not hang during ordinary use, the
  second says the reproduction protocol was applied and the
  controller withstood it or did not. Only controlled_* rows can
  satisfy the A/B/C/D gate.

  !! 3 DISTINCT ENVIRONMENTS above.
     Rows with different env: lines are different EXPERIMENTS and must
     not be added together. Autosuspend state and watchdog mode change
     the controller and can change the outcome, so a kernel comparison
     across them measures the mitigation as much as the kernel.
     `build` names only the kernel; the treatment is build + env.

  !! 2 trial(s) CHANGED or PERTURBED mid-run.
     Their treatment string begins CHANGED: or PERTURBED: so it
     matches no other trial and cannot pool into any denominator.
     A trial that was reconfigured while running, or whose
     controller was reset by something other than the protocol,
     was not conducted under one condition, and no rate computed
     from it means anything.
